WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.500
[The Reso speech overlay opens browser capture.]

00:05.000 --> 00:13.800
Then it will start to capture everything you say and turn them into captions.

00:14.000 --> 00:17.500
I'm very angry.

00:18.000 --> 00:21.000
I'm sad.

00:21.000 --> 00:24.000
I'm very happy.

00:24.000 --> 00:27.000
I'm surprised.

00:27.000 --> 00:30.200
I guess not everything works, huh?
